  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-QmVB85Gk\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-QmVB85Gk\">视频教程</h1><div data-type=\"video\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%BD%99%E9%A2%9D%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E6%BC%94%E7%A4%BA.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A28620885%2C%22id%22%3A%22EAwnu%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22percent%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Flf3-openapi.byteadverts.com%2Fobj%2Fopen-api-file-public%2F4de4bb745d9a0f3fe91e7fcde0fb87ec%22%2C%22naturalWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22naturalHeight%22%3A940%2C%22width%22%3A742%2C%22height%22%3A363%7D\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"qz-video-contain\"><video controls=\"\" src=\"https://lf3-openapi.byteadverts.com/obj/open-api-file-public/4de4bb745d9a0f3fe91e7fcde0fb87ec\" webkit-playsinline=\"webkit-playsinline\" playsinline=\"playsinline\" style=\"outline:none;\" widht=\"742\" height=\"363\"></video></div><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\">使用场景</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-qjJ0LV18\">目前账户余额不足后，客户广告消耗投放不出去后，会造成损失</p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\">解决思路</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-iqLgIWdb\">通过创建一个定时的监控脚本，监控代理商账户下所有adv账户资金状态，若账户资金满足某个条件（如现金余额少于300元），则向企业IM群（如飞书群）发送通知</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kS5WmM7t\">由于飞书群消息卡片长度限制，本示例代码仅会推送前50个触发余额判断条件的账户</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22692px%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E5%95%86%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E4%B8%8B%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E8%B5%84%E9%87%91%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%EF%BC%8C%E8%8B%A5%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E8%B5%84%E9%87%91%E6%BB%A1%E8%B6%B3%E6%9F%90%E4%B8%AA%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%88%E5%A6%82%E7%8E%B0%E9%87%91%E4%BD%99%E9%A2%9D%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%8E300%E5%85%83%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E5%9